ht: 22.45pt; text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<ul>\n \t<li>Hostel Committee (Warden)</li>\n \t<li>ANTI-RAGGING COMMITTEE</li>\n \t<li>GRIEVANCE REDRESSAL COMMITTEE</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Roles and Responsibilities: Department Level</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<ul>\n \t<li>Website</li>\n \t<li>NIRF</li>\n \t<li>Lab in-charge</li>\n \t<li>Department File management</li>\n \t<li>ATMEYA</li>\n \t<li>Mentor</li>\n \t<li>Class Teacher</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
